	(text "Rev B: four SMF5.0A (5 V standoff, 200 W, pin 1 = cathode to the line), the part already used for D2/D3,\ninstead of rev A's SP0504 4-line array: on one copper layer a single SOT-23-5 cannot reach four parallel\nlead lines without a crossing. The TVS capacitance (~1 nF) sits before the 1 kΩ / 100 nF filter: harmless."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.62 215.9 0)
